  "id": "Camden-2026_1079_P",
  "appeal_status": null,
  "appeal_start_date": null,
  "description": "Continued use of 105 Camley Street for F1(a) use until 31 August 2029 (retrospective).",
  "development_type": "Minor all other minor developments",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted must be begun not later than the end of three years from the date of this permission.\r\n\r\nReason: In order to comply with the provisions of Section 91 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).\r\n\r\n",
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans: 275 P00 Rev A, 275 P LOC, Transport Statement February 2026, Abacus Travel Plan 25-26.\r\n\r\nReason: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interest of proper planning.\r\n",
    "Condition : 3 - The use hereby permitted is for a temporary period only and shall cease on or before 31/08/2029, at which time the premises shall revert to their former lawful use for sports centre facility purposes (Class D2 use).\r\n\r\nReason: In order that the long term use of the site may be properly considered in accordance with policy C3 (Cultural and leisure facilities) of the London Borough of Camden Local Plan.\r\n",
    "Condition : 4 - This permission is personal to Abacus Primary School and shall enure for the period of their occupation only. On Abacus Primary School vacating the premises the use shall revert to the lawful use for sports centre facility purposes (Class D2 use).\r\n\r\nReason: In recognition of the special circumstances of the applicant/intended occupier and to accord with policy C3 (Cultural and leisure facilities) of the London Borough of Camden Local Plan.\r\n",
    "Condition : 5 - No persons shall use the building after school hours between 1800 hours and 0800 hours the next day Monday to Friday and at no time during week-ends or Bank Holidays.\r\n\r\nReason: To safeguard the amenities of adjoining premises and the area generally in accordance with the requirements of policy A (Managing the impact of development) of the London Borough of Camden Local Plan.\r\n",
    "Condition : 6 - The development shall be carried out in accordance with the School Development Travel Plan hereby approved unless otherwise agreed in writing with the local planning authority and all reviews shall be submitted for monitoring purposes.\r\n\r\nReason: In order to ensure that the travel demand arising from the development does not significantly impact on the existing transport system and to accord with the requirements of policies A1, T1 and T2 of the Camden Local Plan 2017.\r\n"
  ],
